schema_id: atlas.training-execution-candidate
schema_version: 1
schema_kind: training_execution_candidate
status: ACTIVE

description: >
  One exact Parent Atlas training configuration candidate. Categorical execution
  choices such as ZeRO stage, optimizer implementation, and offload placement are
  never interpolated. Continuous/semi-continuous coordinates may later participate
  in a measured surrogate surface, but every candidate must be executed and receipted
  before it can be considered proven.

fields:
  schema: { type: literal, value: atlas.training-execution-candidate.v1 }
  candidateId: { type: string, required: true }
  baseModelRevision: { type: string, required: true }
  datasetSnapshotId: { type: string, required: true }
  objective:
    type: enum
    values: [SFT, DPO, PPO, REWARD_MODELING]
  peftMethod:
    type: enum
    values: [LORA, QLORA, LORA_FA]
  zeroStage:
    type: enum
    values: [0, 1, 2, 3]
  optimizer:
    type: enum
    values: [ADAMW, PAGED_ADAMW_8BIT, DEEPSPEED_CPU_ADAM]
  optimizerPlacement:
    type: enum
    values: [GPU, CPU, NVME]
  parameterPlacement:
    type: enum
    values: [GPU, CPU, NVME]
  gradientCheckpointing:
    type: enum
    values: [NONE, SELECTIVE, FULL]
  microBatch: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
  gradientAccumulation: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
  effectiveBatch: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
  learningRate: { type: number, minimumExclusive: 0 }
  loraRank: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
  loraAlpha: { type: number, minimumExclusive: 0 }
  targetModuleSetId: { type: string, required: true }
  targetModules: { type: string_array, required: true }
  precision:
    type: enum
    values: [FP32, BF16, FP16]
  quantizationMode: { type: string, required: true }
  requestedGpuBytes: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
  requestedHostBytes: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
  requestedNvmeBytes: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
  environmentReceiptId: { type: string, required: true }
  seed: { type: string, required: true }
  producerRevision: { type: string, required: true }
  checksum: { type: string, required: true }

invariants:
  - zeroStage is categorical; values between 0, 1, 2, and 3 are invalid
  - optimizer offload to CPU/NVME requires zeroStage >= 1
  - parameterPlacement CPU/NVME requires zeroStage == 3
  - DEEPSPEED_CPU_ADAM requires optimizerPlacement CPU or NVME and a DeepSpeed execution plan
  - PAGED_ADAMW_8BIT is a bitsandbytes optimizer choice and is not equivalent to DeepSpeedCPUAdam
  - QLORA requires a compatible trainable checkpoint plus a frozen quantized base and trainable adapter parameters
  - GGUF inference artifacts must never be used as the trainable checkpoint identity
  - targetModules must be proved against the actual model architecture
  - a surrogate proposal does not become a training candidate result until an AdapterTrainingReceiptV1 exists
